      "id": "JP29-CONTENT-01",
      "claim_id": "jp_sdp_fukushima_tenure_record_2003_2013",
      "severity": "bounded_content_wording",
      "finding": "The English claim and uncertainty call the five elections five subsequent re-elections. The Japanese resignation report says five consecutive unopposed election wins, while the contemporaneous 2012 report explicitly calls that her fifth election. The stronger English wording implies six total wins and should be corrected or the ambiguity recorded.",
      "requested_change": "Use neutral five consecutive uncontested leader-election wins, remove the unsupported five additional re-elections wording in both claim/extract mirrors, and preserve absence of new holder boundaries.",
